                    <p><div class="v_news_content">
<style>.docx-wrapper { background: gray; padding: 30px; padding-bottom: 0px; display: flex; flex-flow: column; align-items: center;} .docx-wrapper>section.docx { background: white; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); margin-bottom: 30px;}.docx { color: black; hyphens: auto;}section.docx { box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-flow: column nowrap; position: relative; overflow: hidden;}section.docx>article { margin-bottom: auto; z-index: 1;}section.docx>footer { z-index: 1;}.docx table { border-collapse: collapse;}.docx table td, .docx table th { vertical-align: top;}.docx p { margin: 0pt !important; min-height: 1em;}.docx span { white-space: pre-wrap; overflow-wrap: break-word;}.docx a { color: inherit; text-decoration: inherit;}</style><style>.docx {  --docx-majorhansi-font: Calibri Light;  --docx-minorhansi-font: Calibri;  --docx-dk1-color: #000000;  --docx-lt1-color: #FFFFFF;  --docx-dk2-color: #44546A;  --docx-lt2-color: #E7E6E6;  --docx-accent1-color: #4874CB;  --docx-accent2-color: #EE822F;  --docx-accent3-color: #F2BA02;  --docx-accent4-color: #75BD42;  --docx-accent5-color: #30C0B4;  --docx-accent6-color: #E54C5E;  --docx-hlink-color: #0026E5;  --docx-folhlink-color: #7E1FAD;}</style><style>.docx span {  font-family: Times New Roman;}.docx p, p.docx_1 {  text-align: justify;}.docx p, p.docx_1 span {  font-family: var(--docx-minorHAnsi-font);  min-height: 10.50pt;  font-size: 10.50pt;}.docx table, table.docx_2 td {  padding-top: 0.00pt;  padding-left: 5.40pt;  padding-bottom: 0.00pt;  padding-right: 5.40pt;}span.docx_4 {  font-weight: bold;}</style><section class="docx"><article><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; vertical-align: baseline; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">各学院：</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">为了进一步加强研究生学位论文的过程管理，确保学位授予质量，研究生院将组织专家对本次申请授位研究生的学位论文进行抽查评估。现将有关事项通知如下：</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">一、抽查范围</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（一）博士研究生</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1.2026年6月校抽查评估缓授的博士研究生100%抽查，共1人；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2.毕业与学位授予分离的博士研究生100%抽查，共6人；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">3.指导教师指导的第一届通过论文答辩的博士研究生100%抽查，共8人；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">4.学位论文评阅意见“优秀”以下的有4份及以上的博士研究生100%抽查，共12</span><span id="_GoBack"></span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">人；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">5.按20%随机抽查，共10人。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（二）硕士研究生</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">国务院学位委员会办公室组织的博士学位论文抽检结果为“不合格”</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">学位论文</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">及2024年陕西省硕士学位论文抽检中有“存在问题论文”的指导教师按照所指导硕士研究生答辩通过人数的100%抽查，共6人；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2.学位论文评阅意见有2份及以上低于80分的硕士研究生按照100%抽查，共22人；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">3.按15%随机抽查，共16人。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">二、抽查方式及抽查结果处理</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">研究生院组织同行专家对研究生学位论文进行抽查评估。抽查评估包含学位论文规范性检测和学位论文评审两个环节。学位论文规范性检测的结果分为“通过”和“不通过”；学位论文评审结果分为“优秀”“良好”“一般”和“不合格”。专家如果对被抽查学位论文提出了修改意见，被抽查者必须严格按照专家意见修改学位论文并填写修改审定单，经导师签字确认后方可向各学院以及校图书馆提交学位论文。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">三、抽查材料提交</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">请</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">学位答辩通过的所有研究生在“研究生综合管理平台</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">-学位环节</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">”</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">提交相关材料电子版</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（具体操作流程见附件</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">3</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">）</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">各学院于</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">9</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">4</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日（周</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">五</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">）下午</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">16:00</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">前</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">完成审核。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">要求如下：</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">一</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">）提交相似性检测论文</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（所有答辩通过</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">的研究生</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">均</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">须</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">提交）</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">学生</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">提交用于相似性检测的电子版学位论文，论文为学位论文的正文部分（除去封面、目录、参考文献、附录、致谢、公开发表论文等）。电子版论文的命名规则为“学号-作者姓名-论文题目-学科（领域）-导师姓名.doc/docx/pdf”。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">二</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">）提交抽查评估论文</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（仅被抽查</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">的研究生</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">提交，名单见附件）</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">提交用于抽查评估的电子版学位论文PDF版，论文的封面及正文中隐去作者学号、姓名、指导教师姓名、学院、学科（领域）及学科门类等相关信息，作者本人的研究成果请保留（删除具体作者信息，体现作者的排序，如第一作者、第一发明人等）。电子版论文的命名规则为“学号.pdf”。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">以上电子版论文</span><span lang="null" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">学生端提交，学院完成审核。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">不接收研究生个人发送的电子版论文。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">附件：1.202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">年</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">9</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">月博士研究生学位论文抽查评估名单</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 80pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2.202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">年</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">9</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">月硕士研究生学位论文抽查评估名单</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 80pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">3.研究生系统-抽查评估提交论文操作说明</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; vertical-align: baseline;"><br></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">研究生院</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;"> &nbsp; </span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">202</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">6</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">年</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">9</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">月</span><span lang="en-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">4</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日</span></p></article></section>
</div></p>
 </div>
